    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "In lazyvim there is this configuration https://www.lazyvim.org/extras/util/mini-hipatterns any idea how i can remove the background and only have the fg set?\r\n\r\nI tried change bg to fg but no luck :(",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">In lazyvim there is this configuration <a href=\"https://www.lazyvim.org/extras/util/mini-hipatterns\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.lazyvim.org/extras/util/mini-hipatterns</a> any idea how i can remove the background and only have the fg set?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I tried change bg to fg but no luck :(</p>",
    "bodyText": "In lazyvim there is this configuration https://www.lazyvim.org/extras/util/mini-hipatterns any idea how i can remove the background and only have the fg set?\nI tried change bg to fg but no luck :(",
